sequenceDiagram
Title: Derive first key using current DICE policy

participant c as Client
participant hwc as HwCrypto

c->>+hwc: deriveCurrentDicePolicyBoundKey(derivationKey=DEVICE_BOUND_KEY)
hwc-->>-c: (opaqueDerivationKey1, generated_policy_1)

c->>+hwc: deriveKey(derivationKey=opaqueDerivationKey1, keyParameters=keySize, context="aKey")
hwc-->>-c: (clear_aKey_ver_1)

Note over c,hwc: clients stores generated_policy_1 to be able to re-derive clear_aKey_ver_1
